msgid ""
"Everything a typical application needs can be imported from the top-level `ebarimt_pos_sdk` "
"package. `RetrySettings` is imported from `ebarimt_pos_sdk.settings`."
msgstr ""
"Ердийн програмд хэрэгтэй бүхнийг дээд түвшний `ebarimt_pos_sdk` багцаас импортолж болно. "
"`RetrySettings`-ийг `ebarimt_pos_sdk.settings`-ээс импортолно."
